Stash is a web-based library organizer and viewer for adult media
collections (scenes, images, galleries): metadata scraping (StashDB
and friends), tagging, performers, preview and sprite generation.

This port packages the official upstream FreeBSD binary from GitHub
releases (asset "stash-freebsd"; the web UI is embedded in the
binary). ffmpeg from ports handles previews/sprites/transcoding on
the CPU -- Intel VAAPI is not available on FreeBSD (see the homelab
docs/freebsd/03 migration plan decision).

WWW: https://github.com/stashapp/stash
